        {
            "id": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/self-portrait.html",
            "url": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/self-portrait.html",
            "title": "Self-Portrait",
            "summary": "I keep finding pieces of myself in the lines that take too long to form a shape in the colors that wait too long to settle or to escape Some marks connect, some break All refuse to be final -jujube",
            "content_html": "<p>I keep finding pieces of myself <br>in the lines <br>that take too long to form a shape <br>in the colors <br>that wait too long to settle or to escape <br>Some marks connect, some break <br>All refuse to be final</p>\n<p>-jujube</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/138/portraitideas.png\" alt=\"watercolor and ink drawing of a young woman, messy sketch vibe\" width=\"500\" height=\"377\"></figure>",
